OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrest after man
OL,4,Astabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 25-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder following
OL,8,Freports of a stabbing in Scunthorpe.
OL,10,FHumberside Police said officers were
OL,11,Fcalled to reports a man had been
OL,12,Fstabbed in the chest during an
OL,13,Faltercation outside a property on
OL,14,FGeorge Street shortly after 17:00 GMT
OL,15,Fon Tuesday.
OL,17,FA 40-year-old man was taken to hospital
OL,18,Fwith life-threatening injuries, the
OL,19,Fforce added.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
